<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-032" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao" source-id="s-nanqishu-032-chuzhao-ws1513918">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao:p001:m0001" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAAAA">炤</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao:p001:m0004" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAAAA">彥宣</persName>，少秉高節，一目眇，官至國子博士，不拜。常非從兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao:p001:m0030" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">淵</persName>身事二代，聞<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao:p001:m0037" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">淵</persName>拜司徒，歎曰：「使<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-chuzhao:p001:m0047" ref="jyx_72x_8t2">淵</persName>作中書郎而死，不當是一名士邪！名德不昌，遂令有期頤之壽。」</p>
</text>
